\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the original vector is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379280 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379281 13194139536010 true] [17592186379280 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536010 true] [17592186379280 1041 "field-1" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379280 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379281 13194139536010 true] [17592186379280 1110 #uuid "b6099022-befe-5030-a967-074c59118117" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379281 1034 "-2" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379281 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536010 true] [17592186379281 1111 #uuid "9cc78149-c373-5a4d-9532-ecfd86aa4a09" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379282 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379283 13194139536010 true] [17592186379282 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536010 true] [17592186379282 1041 "field-2" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379282 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379283 13194139536010 true] [17592186379282 1110 #uuid "e26931db-9080-575c-aa98-70707f72bb2f" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379283 1034 "2" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379283 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536010 true] [17592186379283 1111 #uuid "888bc2d2-9e81-5d58-8d0b-18ed53aa14ca" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379284 1017 #edb/ref 17592186379285 13194139536010 true] [17592186379284 1089 "q-85082" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379284 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536010 true] [17592186379284 1100 "The vector $v$ in the plane is mapped to the vector $[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ under the action of the linear transformation $T$ whose matrix $T$ is given by\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nWhat is the original vector $v?$" 13194139536010 true] [17592186379284 1113 #uuid "612312a8-5a63-51fc-aaa1-05ecae9204ea" 1319413953601